WEBVTT

00:03.110 --> 00:04.970
<i>This is the Yunoha region.</i>

00:05.390 --> 00:10.470
<i>It lies northeast of my mansion, 
about three hours by horse carriage.</i>

00:11.540 --> 00:15.240
Allen, the weather is beautiful today.

00:15.240 --> 00:18.240
Yes, the perfect day for a trip.

00:27.080 --> 00:31.630
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

01:55.550 --> 02:00.010
<b>Naughty Hot Spring Trip</b>

01:56.000 --> 01:57.000
Allen!

01:57.000 --> 01:57.920
Hm?

01:58.510 --> 02:00.260
Are you finished with the book already?

02:00.260 --> 02:02.890
Yes! The book you selected for me

02:02.890 --> 02:07.010
taught me so much about this 
country, the time just flew by!

02:07.010 --> 02:09.560
Lost in books and forgetting about time...

02:09.560 --> 02:12.880
In a busy society, it's a 
luxurious, naughty thing.

02:13.280 --> 02:18.770
Eruca's and your alma mater, Athena 
Magical Academy, was also in the book.

02:18.770 --> 02:20.770
It's such a big school.

02:21.030 --> 02:24.300
If you add up the number 
of students, faculty,

02:24.300 --> 02:27.070
and other staff, it's close to the 
population of a small island.

02:27.740 --> 02:30.550
Charlotte, are there other places 
you wanted to check out?

02:30.880 --> 02:32.920
Let's see...

02:32.920 --> 02:36.300
There are a lot, but if 
I have to pick one...

02:37.880 --> 02:42.790
I-If I tell you the place I want 
to visit, what happens...?

02:42.790 --> 02:45.160
That will determine tomorrow's destination!

02:45.160 --> 02:46.290
I knew it!

02:46.560 --> 02:47.900
Do you not like long trips?

02:47.900 --> 02:51.210
Women do seem to pack
a lot when they travel...

02:51.210 --> 02:52.150
N-No!

02:52.150 --> 02:54.560
That's not what it is.

02:54.860 --> 03:00.000
I'm indebted to you, so I couldn't 
ask you to take me on a long trip...

03:00.000 --> 03:01.960
There's no need to hold back.

03:02.210 --> 03:07.450
But I like spending time with 
you at this mansion the most.

03:08.270 --> 03:10.150
<i>She's not lying.</i>

03:10.150 --> 03:10.940
<i>But...</i>

03:11.330 --> 03:15.230
Also, naughty things are great 
because you don't do them every day.

03:15.230 --> 03:18.850
If I did naughty things all the 
time, I'd be a naughty girl!

03:19.260 --> 03:23.090
Yes, you have a point there, but...

03:23.450 --> 03:26.620
<i>I do not mean to corrupt her.</i>

03:26.620 --> 03:30.930
<i>I just want her to experience joys 
that she's never had the chance to.</i>

03:31.680 --> 03:33.970
<i>I </i>can't<i> back down here!</i>

03:33.970 --> 03:35.680
Listen, Charlotte.

03:35.680 --> 03:39.850
If I take you on a trip, you 
will no doubt be happy, right?

03:40.090 --> 03:43.100
You are... right, but...

03:43.330 --> 03:45.230
That's what I want to see!

03:45.880 --> 03:47.610
B-But...

03:47.930 --> 03:49.610
<i>This works!</i>

03:50.050 --> 03:52.100
It's going to be a fun trip.

03:52.100 --> 03:57.040
We can relish the local cuisine, or 
we can tour around sightseeing spots.

03:57.040 --> 03:59.630
We can take a nap at the inn.

03:59.630 --> 04:01.930
It might be nice to soak in a hot spring.

04:01.930 --> 04:03.130
H-Hot spring!

04:04.820 --> 04:07.480
Now, tell me where you want to go.

04:07.480 --> 04:10.650
Then I shall grant your wish.

04:11.330 --> 04:13.640
I will not tell you, not ever!

04:14.870 --> 04:16.530
You can be so stubborn.

04:16.530 --> 04:18.650
Then I'll have to rely on my last resort.

04:18.970 --> 04:20.930
I'll put a death curse on myself—

04:20.930 --> 04:23.650
I've asked you to please not do that!

04:24.730 --> 04:26.670
How are you, nya?

04:32.640 --> 04:35.930
Hello there, Demon Lord and Lottie.

04:36.380 --> 04:39.650
I thought you finished your 
deliveries in the morning?

04:39.650 --> 04:43.540
I come bearing a special 
delivery for you two, nya.

04:43.540 --> 04:45.040
Delivery?

04:45.040 --> 04:46.420
For us?

04:47.970 --> 04:50.470
Wait till you hear this, nya!

04:50.470 --> 04:51.420
Behold!

04:51.420 --> 04:54.950
It's a present: a trip to the Yunoha region for two!

04:55.950 --> 04:56.930
Huh?!

05:02.140 --> 05:03.580
Wow...

05:03.580 --> 05:06.000
Do you think this is so fascinating?

05:06.000 --> 05:07.250
Yes!

05:07.250 --> 05:09.980
The Neruz Kingdom has a lot of mountains.

05:09.980 --> 05:12.950
So I've never seen such a beautiful plain before.

05:13.360 --> 05:17.830
While I was running away from my captors, 
I snuck onto a horse wagon once.

05:18.210 --> 05:22.050
But back then, I didn't have the 
luxury of enjoying the view.

05:22.050 --> 05:23.450
I-I see.

05:23.450 --> 05:25.720
<i>I chose the wrong topic!</i>

05:25.720 --> 05:29.100
Ahem. This area is rather rural.

05:29.100 --> 05:32.080
It seems that your wanted 
posters haven't reached here.

05:32.080 --> 05:34.090
You can let your guard down and relax.

05:34.090 --> 05:35.180
Thank you!

05:35.180 --> 05:38.600
It's like a dream to be able 
to go out without a disguise!

05:40.820 --> 05:43.620
Well, the view isn't too bad.

05:44.460 --> 05:45.860
I know, right?

05:46.120 --> 05:49.690
But it was very thoughtful of 
the townspeople to do this.

05:50.120 --> 05:52.100
To: Great Demon Lord

05:51.060 --> 05:55.050
Allen, are you sure you don't 
mind my accompanying you?

05:55.050 --> 05:58.130
Perhaps you should have 
invited Eruca instead?

05:58.360 --> 06:01.370
No, apparently she has some errands to run.

06:02.120 --> 06:04.500
I'm leaving town for a couple of days.

06:04.500 --> 06:07.870
I also need to investigate the thing 
in the Neruz Kingdom you asked me about.

06:08.260 --> 06:11.130
<i>She'd better be taking the 
investigation seriously.</i>

06:15.250 --> 06:17.970
I totally got you, Bro!

06:17.970 --> 06:22.560
Buying the trip tickets using the thank-you 
money from the neighborhood association...

06:22.560 --> 06:26.650
Eruca, your plan "Operation Hot 
Spring Trip" was a success, nya!

06:26.920 --> 06:30.520
Someone's got to give them the push.

06:30.520 --> 06:34.670
I'm excited to see how much their 
relationship will move forward on this trip!

06:34.670 --> 06:37.710
I took some paid leave for this, nya.

06:37.710 --> 06:40.920
I'm determined to see them grow close, nya!

06:41.270 --> 06:42.410
What was <i>that</i>?

06:42.410 --> 06:44.160
I just felt chills...

06:44.160 --> 06:45.420
Allen?

06:45.420 --> 06:46.580
I'm fine.

06:46.580 --> 06:49.180
By the way, we should be 
seeing it any time now.

06:49.600 --> 06:51.410
Oh, is that...?

06:52.130 --> 06:54.250
The inn we'll be staying at.

06:54.930 --> 06:58.240
That inn is in this book, too.

06:58.240 --> 06:59.930
Take a look, Allen!

07:00.260 --> 07:02.370
"The most popular inn in the Yunoha region.

07:02.370 --> 07:04.940
A new resort hotel with three stars..."

07:05.190 --> 07:08.160
"On top of their hot spring, they're 
known for variety of services

07:08.160 --> 07:11.720
from food to massages, with 
many repeat customers."

07:12.270 --> 07:17.180
With my advice, we picked the 
perfect plan for the Demon Lord, nya!

07:17.180 --> 07:20.210
I hope they enjoy it, nya!

07:20.550 --> 07:24.580
Does that hotel happen to be the 
one you were most interested in?

07:24.580 --> 07:26.460
Huh?! Um...

07:27.800 --> 07:28.590
Yes.

07:28.590 --> 07:29.590
That's a lie.

07:29.590 --> 07:31.720
How did you know?!

07:31.720 --> 07:34.200
<i>Anyone could tell that it was a lie.</i>

07:34.800 --> 07:37.340
Hm. So it's not this one.

07:37.340 --> 07:39.800
Then is it this hotel on an isolated island?

07:39.800 --> 07:42.850
Oh wait, if it's a hotel that's 
popular with women, then...

07:42.170 --> 07:44.350
S-Stop deducing, please!

07:44.350 --> 07:48.860
I'm looking forward to the hot spring, 
and it's embarrassing...

07:48.860 --> 07:50.190
Embarrassing?

07:50.190 --> 07:53.350
Why would it be embarrassing for me 
to know where you want to go?

07:53.640 --> 08:00.370
B-Because... it's a place a 
little child would want to go.

08:00.370 --> 08:02.630
Hm, I see.

08:03.070 --> 08:06.940
<i>That should narrow down the list.</i>

08:07.470 --> 08:10.370
If you insist, then I won't pry anymore.

08:10.700 --> 08:12.620
But I will tell you this.

08:12.620 --> 08:13.720
Yes?

08:13.720 --> 08:20.030
It's actually rather nice to do things you 
couldn't do as a child as an adult.

08:20.030 --> 08:22.970
That's another naughty thing.

08:23.530 --> 08:30.030
Plus, do you think I'd laugh at you after 
hearing where you want to go because it's childish?

08:31.440 --> 08:32.520
No...

08:32.900 --> 08:35.360
You can tell me when you feel like it.

08:35.360 --> 08:38.030
I'll come with you, wherever it may be.

08:39.720 --> 08:40.740
Okay!

08:47.170 --> 08:50.650
Welcome to the Yunoha Resort!

08:55.670 --> 08:56.930
I'm Crawford.

08:56.930 --> 08:59.500
Thank you for your 
reservation, Mr. Crawford.

08:59.500 --> 09:01.630
Your room is ready.

09:01.630 --> 09:03.060
Would you like us to show it to you now?

09:03.290 --> 09:04.790
That would be great.

09:04.790 --> 09:07.010
Is the hot spring open?

09:07.010 --> 09:08.520
Of course.

09:08.520 --> 09:10.810
It's not too crowded right now.

09:11.740 --> 09:14.280
Perhaps we can go take a bath first.

09:14.280 --> 09:16.810
Y-Yes, if that's okay with you!

09:17.120 --> 09:20.430
<i>Looks like she was indeed looking 
forward to the hot spring at least.</i>

09:20.830 --> 09:24.060
Then allow me to show you 
to the main bathhouse.

09:24.060 --> 09:24.820
Thank you—

09:25.830 --> 09:26.830
Whoa!

09:27.270 --> 09:33.580
I must say we are honored that 
you chose us for your honeymoon!

09:34.320 --> 09:35.610
Honey...

09:35.610 --> 09:36.740
...moon?

09:37.210 --> 09:41.210
Oh? Are you not a married couple?

09:41.210 --> 09:42.220
Wha...?!

09:42.220 --> 09:43.600
N-No, we're not!

09:43.850 --> 09:45.860
Then just lovers!

09:45.860 --> 09:48.060
Lo-Lo-Lo-Lo...

09:48.060 --> 09:49.600
That's not it, either!

09:49.950 --> 09:54.470
By the way, can you tell me 
what made you think that?

09:54.470 --> 09:56.610
Well, that's because...

09:56.970 --> 10:00.520
This is a special package for 
lovers and married couples.

10:01.240 --> 10:03.800
<i>Darn it, Miacha, you tricked us!</i>

10:03.800 --> 10:06.370
<i>She did look unnaturally happy!</i>

10:07.440 --> 10:08.380
Silly Bro.

10:08.380 --> 10:11.030
Obviously, we weren't gonna let 
this end up like a normal trip!

10:11.030 --> 10:14.440
This is the perfect travel 
plan for the Demon Lord!

10:14.440 --> 10:17.510
So, what are you going to do, Bro?

10:17.510 --> 10:22.010
If you're not satisfied with the 
plan, you can of course change it.

10:22.390 --> 10:29.200
But this is our most luxurious plan, so 
your companion would probably like it.

10:29.200 --> 10:30.780
I-In that case...

10:32.230 --> 10:36.020
W-We'll take the special plan for 
l-lovers and married couples!

10:36.020 --> 10:37.930
With pleasure!

10:37.930 --> 10:38.790
Yes!

10:38.790 --> 10:41.700
Lo-Lo-Lo-Lo...

10:42.070 --> 10:45.080
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

10:45.080 --> 10:48.080
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

10:49.790 --> 10:54.090
Excuse me, please have this welcome drink on the house.

10:54.660 --> 10:56.590
Why only one serving?

10:58.030 --> 11:01.090
It's a part of the plan for 
lovers and married couples.

11:01.090 --> 11:03.580
Lo-Lo-Lo-Lo...

11:03.580 --> 11:06.060
Here's another challenge, Bro!

11:06.060 --> 11:09.590
Share a drink with Charlotte 
and be lovey-dovey...

11:09.590 --> 11:12.560
Lo-Lo-Lo-Lo...

11:14.370 --> 11:16.620
Here we are.

11:17.030 --> 11:21.110
These are our hot spring facilities. 
We're very proud of them.

11:21.740 --> 11:24.630
All of them use the natural
underground hot springs.

11:24.630 --> 11:27.840
The open-air bath is the most popular one,

11:27.840 --> 11:30.130
because you have an
amazing view of the ocean.

11:30.550 --> 11:32.620
Hm, that sounds good.

11:33.090 --> 11:38.500
<i>If I take in the view as I soak, it should 
help settle this uneasy feeling in my chest...</i>

11:38.500 --> 11:42.770
By the way, have you brought your swimsuits?

11:42.770 --> 11:44.390
S-Swimsuits?!

11:44.390 --> 11:45.940
Why?

11:46.260 --> 11:47.880
Why, do you ask?

11:47.880 --> 11:53.520
It's because our bath is a mixed bath for 
men and women, so you'd need swimsuits!

11:53.790 --> 11:54.760
What?!

11:55.070 --> 11:59.280
Then I'll escort your female guest.

11:59.550 --> 12:06.390
We have tons of cute rental swimsuits, so 
please take your time to pick your favorite.

12:06.390 --> 12:07.280
Wh-What?!

12:12.130 --> 12:13.780
<i>For real?</i>

12:14.140 --> 12:19.060
<i>They said it wasn't too crowded right 
now, but there's still a lot of people around.</i>

12:19.620 --> 12:22.820
<i>It's true that you can enjoy 
a spacious bath this way,</i>

12:22.820 --> 12:26.290
<i>rather than separating it for men and women.</i>

12:26.290 --> 12:30.310
<i>But swimsuits...!</i>

12:30.310 --> 12:36.680
<i>What will happen to me when I 
see Charlotte in a swimsuit...?</i>

12:37.020 --> 12:39.950
<i>If worst comes to worst, I'll stop 
my heart, and I'll keep on stopping it!</i>

12:40.230 --> 12:43.450
Um... I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

12:44.850 --> 12:46.830
<i>Stay calm, stay calm!</i>

12:46.830 --> 12:50.460
Oh, I just got here... too...

12:55.760 --> 12:58.940
<i>I didn't need to stop my heart.</i>

12:58.940 --> 13:00.920
<i>Because it was already stopped.</i>

13:03.470 --> 13:05.600
Rest in peace, nya.

13:05.600 --> 13:08.460
I guess it was too stimulating for Bro.

13:08.820 --> 13:10.580
A-Allen?

13:11.740 --> 13:17.090
I-I knew it wouldn't look good on me...

13:17.090 --> 13:18.600
N-No!

13:23.800 --> 13:25.600
It looks great on you!

13:25.600 --> 13:28.000
Y-You think so?

13:28.000 --> 13:32.770
I-I think you look great in yours, too...

13:32.770 --> 13:34.930
Oh, I see.

13:34.930 --> 13:36.430
I guess it goes both ways.

13:36.430 --> 13:38.370
What does?

13:38.370 --> 13:40.080
It's nothing.

13:40.940 --> 13:43.050
More importantly, we should go!

13:43.990 --> 13:49.050
Let's enjoy naughty things we can 
only do at a hot spring resort!

13:53.260 --> 13:54.470
What a smash!

14:00.280 --> 14:02.510
It feels nice.

14:02.510 --> 14:04.020
Indeed.

14:04.380 --> 14:07.140
I wish we could be here forever.

14:07.140 --> 14:08.520
Indeed.

14:08.910 --> 14:11.670
Charlotte has been looking 
forward to the hot spring.

14:11.670 --> 14:15.410
A naughty activity here is 
the "main dish" of the trip!

14:15.410 --> 14:18.200
But they're simply chilling 
and relaxing, nya.

14:18.200 --> 14:21.040
I'll get dizzy from the long bath soon, nya.

14:21.370 --> 14:26.310
This is my first time at a hot spring, 
but I never knew how wonderful it was.

14:26.310 --> 14:30.520
This isn't the only way to 
enjoy a hot spring, Charlotte.

14:30.520 --> 14:31.300
What?

14:31.660 --> 14:35.140
I have brought you what you ordered, sir.

14:35.140 --> 14:36.680
Perfect timing.

14:36.680 --> 14:37.890
I appreciate it.

14:37.890 --> 14:40.300
Allen, what did you...?

14:40.690 --> 14:43.320
Eating ice cream as you soak in a hot spring:

14:43.320 --> 14:45.610
It's a naughty thing you 
can only do at a hot spring.

14:45.610 --> 14:47.320
H-How indulgent!

14:47.590 --> 14:49.810
It's too early to be surprised.

14:51.200 --> 14:52.740
Immortal Ice!

14:51.200 --> 14:53.180
<b>Immortal Ice</b>

