<b>Immortal Ice</b>

14:53.190 --> 14:54.080
<b>Immortal Ice</b>

14:53.190 --> 14:54.080
<b>Immortal Ice</b>

14:57.460 --> 15:00.070
Now it won't melt from the 
heat of the hot spring.

15:00.070 --> 15:01.840
Take your time to enjoy it.

15:01.840 --> 15:03.780
Thank you very much!

15:10.380 --> 15:12.450
<i>She makes it look so good.</i>

15:13.180 --> 15:16.800
The only naughty thing they'll do 
at the hot spring is eat ice cream?!

15:16.800 --> 15:19.360
You're too wholesome, Demon Lord.

15:19.360 --> 15:22.600
Hey, Dad! I want that ice cream too!

15:22.920 --> 15:24.280
I guess you can have it.

15:24.280 --> 15:26.540
But don't tell Mom, she's doing 
a beauty treatment.

15:26.540 --> 15:28.650
Excuse me, can I have one ice cream?

15:28.650 --> 15:30.870
Coming right up!

15:31.240 --> 15:33.050
I want ice cream too!

15:33.050 --> 15:34.870
Me too, me too!

15:37.600 --> 15:41.380
I-I'll take your orders one at a time!

15:41.680 --> 15:44.020
Ice cream sure is popular.

15:44.020 --> 15:45.220
Excuse me...

15:46.200 --> 15:50.170
If you don't mind, could you please 
put your spell on his ice cream?

15:50.170 --> 15:55.010
I want to try the super cold 
ice cream this lady is eating!

15:55.430 --> 15:57.380
He just won't listen...

15:57.630 --> 16:00.180
That's why everyone's ordering it.

16:00.180 --> 16:01.360
Allen.

16:02.040 --> 16:04.020
Of course, no problem!

16:04.020 --> 16:06.400
I'm in a good mood right now.

16:06.750 --> 16:09.660
Come, bring your ice creams to me!

16:10.400 --> 16:12.030
I shall put a spell on them!

16:17.370 --> 16:20.530
Thank you so much for your help today!

16:20.530 --> 16:22.580
Oh no, not a problem.

16:22.580 --> 16:27.430
Actually, thanks to you, our sales 
of ice cream tripled today!

16:27.430 --> 16:32.380
And you graciously put your spell on the 
rest of the containers so they wouldn't melt!

16:32.380 --> 16:34.550
I cannot thank you enough!

16:34.550 --> 16:36.700
I'm sure that's an overstatement.

16:36.700 --> 16:39.300
It's really not a big deal, 
so please don't mention it.

16:39.610 --> 16:42.360
But everyone was so happy.

16:42.360 --> 16:45.060
Allen, you are an amazing sorcerer.

16:45.060 --> 16:46.510
Now you too?

16:46.510 --> 16:49.310
All I did was stop the 
ice cream from melting.

16:49.660 --> 16:52.350
Do you have a plan for 
tomorrow's sightseeing?

16:52.710 --> 16:56.480
If you'd like, we'll do everything 
in our power to make it special.

16:56.480 --> 16:58.320
Please let us thank you!

16:58.550 --> 17:01.520
Well, I appreciate your offer.

17:01.520 --> 17:03.830
Do you have any sites you recommend?

17:04.100 --> 17:07.090
There are plenty of tourist 
attractions around here.

17:07.090 --> 17:13.210
Diving spots, beaches, and there's 
a hill where you can observe fenrirs.

17:13.470 --> 17:15.930
There are fenrirs around here?

17:15.930 --> 17:17.210
"Fenrir"?

17:17.510 --> 17:20.280
They're noble and peaceful 
magical creatures.

17:20.280 --> 17:24.220
It is said that the mere sight of 
them can bring you good luck.

17:24.530 --> 17:28.160
However, it might be a waste 
of your time to go there.

17:28.160 --> 17:30.380
It's their child-rearing season right now,

17:30.380 --> 17:32.490
so they rarely come down from the mountains.

17:32.490 --> 17:35.090
I see, I guess our timing was bad.

17:35.090 --> 17:36.250
That's too bad.

17:36.250 --> 17:40.290
However! There's another spot I can 
recommend for magical creatures!

17:40.290 --> 17:42.980
Behold! It's the Yunoha Magical Zoo!

17:42.980 --> 17:44.540
A zoo!

17:51.970 --> 17:54.260
So this is our room...

17:54.630 --> 17:56.380
O-Oh, wow!

17:56.380 --> 17:57.760
We can see the ocean!

17:58.100 --> 18:01.170
Yes, it's bigger than I expected...

18:01.170 --> 18:02.000
What?!

18:03.630 --> 18:05.310
A-Allen!

18:05.310 --> 18:07.240
I-I-Is this...?

18:07.240 --> 18:10.280
Can you come here right this 
minute, Ms. Concierge?!

18:12.580 --> 18:14.670
This is just the beginning!

18:14.670 --> 18:16.880
You think you're done after eating 
ice cream at a hot spring?

18:16.880 --> 18:19.570
I won't allow such a 
lukewarm romantic comedy!

18:19.910 --> 18:22.250
One bed under one roof!

18:22.250 --> 18:24.210
Something is bound to happen.

18:24.210 --> 18:26.870
What move are you going 
to make, nya, Demon Lord?

18:28.030 --> 18:30.400
L-Let's go to sleep.

18:30.400 --> 18:33.080
Y-Yes, please.

18:33.440 --> 18:36.720
<i>Since this room is for 
lovers and married couples,</i>

18:36.720 --> 18:38.930
<i>this is the bed it's supposed to have.</i>

18:38.930 --> 18:41.100
<i>But how did it come to this...?</i>

18:41.100 --> 18:46.150
It's possible to change your room, but 
this bed is a special custom-made one.

18:46.150 --> 18:49.370
When two people sleep in it, they 
can see whatever dream they want!

18:49.370 --> 18:51.230
So try it just for tonight!

18:51.540 --> 18:54.530
A dreaming bed made by Dream Sprites...

18:54.530 --> 18:56.730
It sure is a rare item.

18:57.110 --> 19:01.490
I'm sorry, Allen, for dragging 
you along for my sake.

19:01.740 --> 19:02.940
Don't worry.

19:02.940 --> 19:05.480
A special bed made by
Dream Sprite artisans,

19:05.480 --> 19:07.610
who have the ability to sneak 
into others' dreams...

19:07.610 --> 19:08.990
I was actually curious about it.

19:11.270 --> 19:14.090
We have an early morning
tomorrow, so let's go to sleep.

19:14.090 --> 19:15.520
Y-Yes.

19:21.950 --> 19:24.740
<i>The bed is quite comfortable.</i>

19:24.740 --> 19:28.310
<i>The height of the pillow and the 
softness of the mattress are perfect—</i>

19:28.310 --> 19:31.010
<i>Jeez, how am I supposed to 
fall asleep like this?!</i>

19:31.290 --> 19:34.030
Allen, are you asleep yet?

19:34.030 --> 19:36.270
No, I'm still awake.

19:36.270 --> 19:39.280
It's hard to fall asleep, isn't it?

19:39.280 --> 19:42.360
Charlotte, have you decided on 
what dream you want to see?

19:43.000 --> 19:44.960
Um, well...

19:44.960 --> 19:48.800
I was hoping to see my 
mom, who passed away.

19:48.800 --> 19:51.730
I used to sleep beside her when I was small.

19:53.050 --> 19:54.040
I see.

19:54.040 --> 19:56.610
Then, all the more reason 
to fall asleep quickly.

19:56.610 --> 20:00.180
B-But it's just hard to fall asleep...

20:00.180 --> 20:01.810
Well, have no fear.

20:05.060 --> 20:07.150
This is light hypnotic magic.

20:07.150 --> 20:09.630
You will soon fall asleep.

20:09.630 --> 20:11.290
Okay...

20:12.010 --> 20:16.350
Good night, Allen...

20:17.310 --> 20:20.200
Y-Yeah, good night.

20:24.080 --> 20:26.560
Looks like the spell worked.

20:27.760 --> 20:30.860
Her breathing pattern is regular and steady.

20:30.860 --> 20:32.730
The glow of her skin looks healthy.

20:33.160 --> 20:37.800
Her eyelashes like a baby deer's, 
and her lustrous, healthy lips...

20:41.220 --> 20:42.660
Deadly Down!

20:41.220 --> 20:42.840
<b>Deadly Down</b>

