<b>Deadly Down</b>

20:41.220 --> 20:42.840
<b>Deadly Down</b>

20:41.220 --> 20:42.840
<b>Deadly Down</b>

20:41.220 --> 20:42.840
<b>Deadly Down</b>

21:04.050 --> 21:05.480
Did you have a good dream?

21:06.950 --> 21:07.950
Yes!

21:07.950 --> 21:10.490
I got to see my mother in my dream!

21:10.780 --> 21:12.820
And I got to talk to her a lot!

21:12.820 --> 21:15.250
I told her about you, Allen!

21:15.740 --> 21:16.710
I see.

21:29.300 --> 21:31.820
<i>Charlotte's beloved mother, 
please rest assured.</i>

21:32.320 --> 21:34.330
<i>I will protect her.</i>

21:37.200 --> 21:38.540
Excuse me.

21:39.110 --> 21:41.910
It's time to check out...

21:50.710 --> 21:52.870
<i>Allen Crawford...</i>

21:52.870 --> 21:57.940
<i>Are you really capable of 
protecting Charlotte Evans?</i>

23:30.810 --> 23:32.480
Today was really fun, wasn't it?

23:32.480 --> 23:32.860
Yeah...

23:32.860 --> 23:35.310
I can't fall asleep, 
thinking about tomorrow!

23:35.310 --> 23:37.280
Next episode, "Naughty Zoo."

23:35.310 --> 23:40.050
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.310 --> 23:40.050

<b>Naughty Zoo</b>

23:37.280 --> 23:40.090
I can't sleep either, because Charlotte 
in her swimsuit is burned in my memory!
